Significance: minor
Type: feat

Added the Event Dates authoring UI: with the Recurrence feature active and Events Calendar Pro absent, additional explicit dates can be authored one by one from the datetime section of the Classic Editor (behind a "Schedule this event on more dates" toggle, using the same date and time pickers as the Start/End row) and from the datetime block of the Block Editor. The rows map to the authored recurrence meta, rule-based events show a protected notice with a read-only summary of the scheduled dates, single occurrences link back to their recurring event, and the Events Calendar Pro upsell banner now sells the recurrence rule patterns specifically.
